Clarity, 120 golden cases it has never seen

  overall  93%

by kind
  composite        6/6     100%  ########################
  document        72/74     97%  #######################
  unanswerable    16/20     80%  ###################
  warehouse       18/20     90%  ######################

by tier
  head            78/80     98%  #######################
  tail            34/40     85%  ####################

by where the case came from
  generated       78/80     98%  #######################
  must refuse     16/20     80%  ###################
  written by hand  18/20     90%  ######################

Overall is 93%, and overall is the least useful line on the page.

98% on cases a script generated, 90% on cases somebody sat and wrote.
The demos in the first twenty chapters were all the first kind.

The line that should bother you is unanswerable: 16 of 20.
That is the number a plan can be built on, and it is invisible in the average.
